{
  "platforms": ["ios", "android"],
  "spec_verified": "2026-08-06",
  "notes": [
    "ios.icon (assets/AppIcon.icon, the SDK54+ Icon Composer directory) is validated by verify.sh Gate A directly against the resolved app config — it is a directory, not a single image, so it is deliberately NOT listed as an asset here (Gate C's shape/format check reads image bytes and would false-fail on a directory).",
    "Screenshot dirs live outside this repo, in the sibling Claude-Cowork-Workspace project folder (projects/RTSH/assets/AppStore-PlayStore/), per this workspace's own convention that deliverables go under projects/<name>/assets and outputs, not into the app's own git repo.",
    "play-feature-graphic has no source file yet (checked 2026-08-06 — nothing in AppStore-PlayStore/ matches Play's 1024x500 spec). Declared required so Gate B fails loudly and names it, rather than the requirement being silently absent from tracking."
  ],
  "assets": [
    {
      "id": "ios-listing-icon",
      "role": "icon",
      "platform": "ios",
      "path": "../assets/AppStore-PlayStore/AppIcons/appstore.png",
      "required": true,
      "shape": { "width": 1024, "height": 1024, "square": true },
      "formats": ["png"],
      "alpha": "forbidden",
      "spec_verified": "2026-08-01",
      "source": "https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/reference/app-icon-specifications"
    },
    {
      "id": "play-listing-icon",
      "role": "icon",
      "platform": "android",
      "path": "../assets/AppStore-PlayStore/AppIcons/playstore.png",
      "required": true,
      "shape": { "width": 512, "height": 512, "square": true },
      "formats": ["png"],
      "alpha": "allowed",
      "spec_verified": "2026-08-01",
      "source": "https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/9866151"
    },
    {
      "id": "android-adaptive-foreground",
      "role": "app-source-icon",
      "platform": "android",
      "path": "./assets/images/android-icon-foreground.png",
      "required": true,
      "shape": { "width": 1024, "height": 1024, "square": true },
      "formats": ["png"],
      "alpha": "required",
      "spec_verified": "2026-08-01",
      "source": "https://docs.expo.dev/versions/latest/config/app/#adaptiveicon"
    },
    {
